<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', height: 80, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 48 }}>
    <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>三种走法：跟跑 / 并跑 / 领跑</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', padding: 36, gap: 24 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: 24, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 8, padding: '8px 14px', alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>跟跑（弱）</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
        代码包已写好。cp env.example .env 填 key → python -m manhua_studio --input 照片.jpg → 出 deliverables/学号/
      </Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>达标线 = 最低档（靠写好的代码包）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>重在跑通 + 读懂"一张照片变一整套商品图"</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: 24, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#3D7BD9', borderRadius: 8, padding: '8px 14px', alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>并跑（中）</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
        填 prompts.py 模板 + 调参数，改出图风格/场景。路径与参数已预设。
      </Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>期望档 = 自己改模板产出不同素材</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>理解提示词如何驱动结果</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: 24, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, padding: '8px 14px', alignSelf: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Text style={{ color: '#FFFFFF', fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>领跑（强）</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
        指到 adapters.py / pipeline.py + 故障练习卡，自己写代码、排错、加构件。
      </Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>挑战档 = 修故障 / 扩展管线</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>三档都写/读代码，只是 AI 扶持度不同</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 64, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 36', background: '#E8EFF8' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230' }}><span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>阶梯钩子：</span>一键包是"入口"不是"差生标签"——能力强的自然想往上爬到并跑/领跑。</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 36, display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'flex-end', padding: '0 48px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>09 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
